# ---- AC10: a unit closing an ask HELD ON a mandated ask that is not terminal.
askreset
askrows 'EXMP-aFoo-3\tOPEN\t-\taFoo\tHIGH\tyes\t-\tEXMP-aFoo-4\t-\t-\nEXMP-aFoo-4\tOPEN\t-\taFoo\tHIGH\tyes\t-\t-\t-\t-\n'
